  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Icke-spridning: Lettland</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Non-proliferation: Latvia - Non-proliferation nuclear</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen best&#xE5;r i tre projekt i Lettland ang icke-spridning. SKI ger st&#xF6;d till inr&#xE4;ttande av den lettiska k&#xE4;rns&#xE4;kerhetsmyndigheten, &apos;Radiation Safety Center&apos;; f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttring av station&#xE4;rt gr&#xE4;nsskydd samt fysiskt skydd vid f&#xF6;rvaringsanl&#xE4;ggningen &apos;Radons&apos;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish Nuclear Power Inspectorate has submitted three project proposals, which concern different aspects of control of nuclear materials in Latvia. The purpose of the projects is to assist Latvian ministries and authorities in the organisation and co-ordination of activities aiming at the reduction of the risk of dissemination of nuclear materials.</narrative>
  </description>
